  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caribbean Economic Development Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support governments in the ODA eligible Caribbean countries (Belize, Dominica, Grenada, Guyana, Jamaica, Saint Lucia, and Saint Vincent and the Grenadines) to strengthen their public financial management systems including tax and customs administration, financial sector surveillance, statistics, government procurement and competitiveness in order to promote private sector development that will build sustainable, competitive and inclusive economies in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
